    "sections": {
        "description": "Geschaft Business is a multipurpose theme with a modern layout and a stylish, unique retina-ready design that makes a strong impression from the very first view of its demo. This theme is ideal for small to large businesses, corporation, agency, consultant, app developer, IT consultant, networking companies, service-based businesses, business coach, consulting, vlog, legal business, landing pages, service and consultancy websites, personal finance, affiliate marketing, software development, financial organization, travel agency, medical services, restaurant, startup, transportation, freelancer agency, business promotion, consulting services, marketing consulting, advertising consulting, financial advisors, investment consultants, accountant services, HR consulting, insurance brokers, industries, fashion, online shop, magazine publishers and more. It also fits well for modern digital businesses focused on growth, branding, and corporate presence. The theme has minimal and optimized code which makes it SEO friendly and performance optimized. It is translation ready, helping businesses expand globally, and fully responsive so it works smoothly across all devices. It includes an elegant Call To Action section to improve engagement and conversions, along with testimonial sections to showcase user experience and build trust. With multiple customization options, you can easily create layouts as per your business needs and style preferences, while integrated social sharing features help improve online visibility and reach."
    },
